<title>KUWAIT: IOEC awarded Iran's Soroush field development.</title>
<headline>IOEC awarded Iran's Soroush field development.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-02-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Iran has awarded the state-owned Iranian Offshore Engineering Construction Company (IOEC) the contract to develop the 60,000 bpd offshore Soroush field.</p>
<p>Iran's Oil Minister Gholamreza Aghazadeh told Reuters in Kuwait the Iranian firm was awarded the contract and other projects would be announced &quot;soon&quot;.</p>
</text>
